<title>USA: Kinark sets price for rights offering.</title>
<headline>Kinark sets price for rights offering.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinark Corp said Monday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a registration statement to offer common stock to its shareholders at about $3 per share.</p>
<p>It said it would make the offer to holders of record on September 27, 1996.</p>
<p>In June, Kinark said it had filed with the commission for rights to offer up to 4.8 million common shares to its shareholders in order to finance the purchase stock in Rogers Galvanizing Co.</p>
</text>
